<title>USA: ConAgra to acquire part of Florida Sea Inc.</title>
<headline>ConAgra to acquire part of Florida Sea Inc.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA, Neb. 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>ConAgra Shrimp Cos, a unit of international food company ConAgra Inc, said Tuesday it signed a definitive agreement to purchase certain assets of Florida Sea Inc.</p>
<p>Florida Sea is a seafood operation currently owned by Schwan's Sales Enterprises Inc of Marshall, Minnesota.</p>
<p>The acquisition, which ConAgra Shrimp said is expected to close October 18, does not include the Florida Sea plant in Plant City, Florida, the company said.</p>
<p>Terms of the acquisition were not disclosed.</p>
<p>--Reuters Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
